# alt_inflight_switch.scn — in-flight switch INTO ALT_HOLD + re-center gate (Case B)
#                          飛行中の ALT_HOLD 進入＋スロットル再センターロック（Case B）
#
# Spec under test (Case B of the re-center gate):
#   The craft auto-takes-off in ALT_HOLD to 0.5 m (deterministic start), drops to
#   STABILIZE briefly (manual throttle ≈ hover, holding ~0.5 m), then flips BACK to
#   ALT_HOLD with the throttle OFF-CENTER. On that STABILIZE→ALT_HOLD switch the
#   controller captures the current altitude AND closes the re-center gate, so the
#   off-center throttle does NOT jump the altitude — it HOLDS. Re-centering (2048)
#   opens the gate; pushing up (4095) then climbs.
#     F [14.7,18.7]: gate CLOSED by the switch → throttle 3330 (norm 0.63) is IGNORED,
#                    altitude settles into a bounded, decaying transient (~0.88 m peak
#                    within the window; see the window note below). Without the gate it
#                    would climb further still.
#     H [22.2,23.2]: after re-centering at G the gate OPENS, so 4095 (full up) climbs.
#
# The F/H windows above follow from E's dwell of 1200 ms (see row E): all downstream absolute times depend on it.
#
# 検証する仕様（スロットル再センターロックの Case B）:
#   ALT_HOLD で 0.5 m へ自動離陸（決定論的な起点）→ 一瞬 STABILIZE（手動スロットル≈ホバーで
#   ~0.5 m 保持）→ スロットルを中央から外したまま ALT_HOLD へ戻す。その STABILIZE→ALT_HOLD
#   切替で制御器が現在高度を捕捉しスロットル再センターロックを掛けるため、中央外スロットルは高度を
#   ジャンプさせず保持する。中央復帰(2048)でロックが解除され、上げ(4095)で上昇する。
# 上記の F/H の窓は E の滞留 1200 ms（E 行を参照）から決まる。以降の絶対時刻はすべてこれに依存する。
#
# ALT_HOLD throttle is the SYMMETRIC axis (raw-2048)/2048 ∈ [-1,+1]: 2048=0=HOLD,
# up(>2048)=climb, down(<2048)=descend. STABILIZE throttle is [0,1] (2048=0=off).
#
# KNOWN-FAIL since 2026-11-23 (ToF histogram merge off removed an accidental brake; the header numbers 0.88 m / alt peak ~1.15 m below are from before): see alt_inflight_switch.expect and simulation-policy.md backlog #26.
# 2026-11-23 から既知の不合格（ToF のヒストグラム併合なしで、偶然のブレーキが無くなった。下の 0.88 m・alt の山 約 1.15 m は変更前の値）: alt_inflight_switch.expect と simulation-policy.md のバックログ #26 を参照。
#
# Run: sf sils scenario simulator/sils/scenarios/alt_inflight_switch.scn --target vehicle
#
#  <t>  ch  <thr> <roll> <pitch> <yaw> <arm> <hold_ms> <rate_hz> <alt> <acro> <pos>
   0    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  0     6000      50                       # A: boot at rest — still calibration completes (~4 s)
   +    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  0     1500      50        1              # B: ALT switch ON while DISARMED → ground mode change
   +    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  1     1000      50        1              # C: ARM in ALT_HOLD — props stop, spool, AUTO-takeoff fires
   +    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  1     3500      50        1              # D: throttle CENTER → climb to 0.5 m and settle
   +    rc   3171  2048   2048    2048  1     1200      50        0              # E: switch to STABILIZE, throttle UP → brief manual climb. Throttle raw 3171 is above the STABILIZE open-loop hover raw 3088 (SILS sweep at 3.87 V), so the craft climbs instead of falling. Dwell 1200 ms keeps a genuine "still climbing when the switch happens" disturbance (alt peak ~1.15 m) without excess margin; a 1500 ms dwell is not used: it carries more climb into the F gate test (alt_max ~1.5 m against the designed ~0.9 m). The F/H windows in alt_inflight_switch.expect follow from this dwell.
   +    rc   3330  2048   2048    2048  1     5500      50        1              # F: flip BACK to ALT_HOLD, throttle OFF-CENTER → gate CLOSED → capture+HOLD (no re-climb)
   +    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  1     1500      50        1              # G: throttle to CENTER (2048 = spring rest) → gate OPENS
   +    rc   4095  2048   2048    2048  1     3000      50        1              # H: throttle FULL UP → gate OPEN → climb
   +    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  0     200       50                       # I: release ARM button
   +    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  1     200       50                       # J: press again → DISARM (toggle)
   +    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  0     600       50                       # K: settle disarmed
